          {
            "title": "Example: Variables",
            "id": 126814,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Usa una variabile che memorizza il risultato di un confronto come condizione dell'istruzione if.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"swift\" name=\"main.swift\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" players = \" /><text value=\"2\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" multiPlayer = players &gt; \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" multiPlayer {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"print\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Set names and choose your characters&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"49\" endIndex=\"60\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"players\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"players &gt; 1\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Set names and choose your characters&#xA;\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>multiPlayer</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Else",
            "id": 126815,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Come chiamiamo la parte di un'istruzione <code>if</code> / <code>else</code> che viene eseguita quando la condizione dell'istruzione <code>if</code> è <code>false</code>?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Un'istruzione <code>else</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Non esiste una condizione di questo tipo</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Un'istruzione <code>if</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Un'istruzione <code>else</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: Else",
            "id": 126816,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Scrivi un'istruzione <code>if</code> vuota (senza blocco di codice) che controlli se <code>membership</code> è uguale a <code>\"gold\"</code>, seguita da un'istruzione <code>else</code> vuota.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"swift\" name=\"main.swift\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" membership = \" /><text value=\"&quot;gold&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" membership == \" /><text value=\"&quot;gold&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"} \" /><text value=\"else\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"24\" endIndex=\"26\" /><option startIndex=\"27\" endIndex=\"47\" /><option startIndex=\"51\" endIndex=\"52\" /><option startIndex=\"53\" endIndex=\"57\" /><option startIndex=\"62\" endIndex=\"63\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"else membership != &quot;gold&quot;\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"(\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\")\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>if</code>, seguito da <code>membership == \"gold\"</code> e poi <code>}</code>, <code>else</code>, <code>}</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: No own condition",
            "id": 126817,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Perché l'istruzione <code>else</code> non ha una propria condizione tra parentesi?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Perché il suo blocco di codice verrà sempre eseguito se la condizione <code>if</code> non viene soddisfatta</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Perché viene sempre eseguito, quindi non ha bisogno di una condizione</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">L'istruzione <code>else</code> ha una condizione tra parentesi</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Perché il suo blocco di codice verrà sempre eseguito se la condizione <code>if</code> non viene soddisfatta.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Catch all",
            "id": 126818,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Cosa succede quando <code>commonFriends</code> ha un valore inferiore a 3?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"swift\" name=\"main.swift\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" commonFriends = ?\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" commonFriends &gt;= \" /><text value=\"3\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"print\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Friend suggestions: Sue&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"} \" /><text value=\"else\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"print\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"&quot;No new suggestions&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Il blocco di codice della clausola <code>else</code> viene eseguito</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Il blocco di codice della clausola <code>if</code> viene eseguito</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Non viene eseguito né il blocco di codice <code>if</code> né il blocco di codice della clausola <code>else</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Il blocco di codice della clausola <code>else</code> viene eseguito.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: Lights on",
            "id": 126819,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Scegli un valore per <code>madMeter</code> in modo che venga eseguito il blocco <code>else</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"swift\" name=\"main.swift\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" madMeter = \" /><text value=\"79\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" madScientist = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Dexter&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" madMeter &gt;= \" /><text value=\"134\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"print\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Madness achieved!&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"} \" /><text value=\"else\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"print\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Sorry&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + madScientist + \" /><text value=\"&quot;not mad enough&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"15\" endIndex=\"17\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"134\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"200\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Sorry, Dexter, not mad enough\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>79</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
